As I understand it, we are working with Nadia Mire to create a hybrid work that brings together her ceramic work and the digital world. 
She wants to bring sound into her art pieces, which I find really interesting.
Would the sound be related to her practice itself, like the sounds of working with clay, or would it be more like music? 
How should the audience react to it, and how would it all be set up? There are still a lot of questions we need to discuss with Nadia.
